## 🎯 Inference System

### Docker-based Multi-Provider (`internal/inference/`)

- **Providers:** vLLM, SGLang, TGI, TEI, llama.cpp, TensorRT-LLM
- Automatic model download from HuggingFace
- Container lifecycle management
- Health checks и metrics

### Configuration

```yaml
inference:
  docker:
    enabled: true
    hf_cache_dir: "./data/models/hf"
    gguf_dir: "./data/models/gguf"
    trt_engines_dir: "./data/engines/trt"
    max_running_models: 2
    default_provider: "vllm"  # vllm | sglang | tgi | llama.cpp | tensorrt-llm
    health_check_timeout: "60s"
    startup_timeout: "5m"
```

### Providers from Database

Providers загружаются из PostgreSQL (`model_providers` table):

```go
// internal/providers/manager.go
func (pm *ProviderManager) LoadProvidersFromDB(ctx context.Context) error {
    providerConfigs, err := pm.db.ListModelProviders(ctx, true)
    
    for _, config := range providerConfigs {
        switch config.ProviderType {
        case models.ProviderTypeOllama:
            provider = NewOllamaProvider(config.Name, config.BaseURL)
        case models.ProviderTypeVLLM:
            provider = NewVLLMProvider(config.Name, config.BaseURL)
        }
        pm.RegisterProvider(config.ID, provider)
    }
}
```

## 📦 Database: PostgreSQL Only

Все миграции и запросы в:

```
internal/storage/postgresql/
├── postgresql.go        # Connection & migrations
├── migrations/          # SQL migration files (230+)
├── apikeys.go
├── users.go
├── tenants.go
├── model_configs.go     # Saved model specs
├── model_registry.go    # Discovered models
└── ...
```

### Синтаксис

- Используй `$1, $2` для параметров
- `ON CONFLICT ... DO UPDATE` для upsert
- UUID для primary keys

## ⚠️ Critical Rules

### НЕ запускай сервер автоматически

```bash
# ✅ Разрешено
go build -o bin/server.exe cmd/server/main.go
go test ./...

# ❌ Запрещено
go run cmd/server/main.go
./bin/server.exe
```

### PostgreSQL Only

- Миграции только в `internal/storage/postgresql/migrations/`
- Используй `$1, $2` placeholders (не `?`)

### Test Coverage

- Все новые handlers должны иметь тесты
- Используй `go test -race ./...`
